==Luxembourgish==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|lb|wierfen||dialectal}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|lb|gmh|werfen}}, from {{inh|lb|goh|werfan}}, from {{inh|lb|gem-pro|*werpaną}}. 

While the verb as such is probably inherited, the form seems to have undergone an irregular development, perhaps under influence of {{der|lb|de|werfen}}; the regular development is found in dialectal {{m|lb|wierfen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lb|/ˈværfen/|[ˈvæχ.fən]}}

===Verb===
{{lb-verb|wërft|geworf}}

# {{lb|lb|intransitive|transitive}} to [[throw]]; to [[toss]]
# {{lb|lb|transitive}} to [[cast]]; to [[throw]] {{gloss|a glance, look, etc.}}
#: {{uxi|lb|e Bléck '''werfen'''|t=to cast a glance; to take a look}}
# {{lb|lb|reflexive}} to [[throw]] oneself

====Conjugation====
{{lb-conj-irregular|werf|wërf|werf|geworf|hunn}}

